  "notes": "{起|お}こる means to occur or happen—used for events, incidents, and changes.\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- {起|お}こる: to occur (events)\n- ⟦{怒|おこ}る→怒る：00876_okoru⟧: to get angry (different kanji)\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {起|お}こる (intransitive): something occurs\n- ⟦{起|お}こす→起こす：01234_okosu⟧ (transitive): to cause something\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{事故|じこ}→事故：00851_jiko⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{起|お}こる: an accident occurs\n- ⟦{問題|もんだい}→問題：00797_mondai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{起|お}こる: a problem arises\n- ⟦{変化|へんか}→変化：03615_henka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{起|お}こる: a change occurs\n- ⟦{地震|じしん}→地震：01608_jishin⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{起|お}こる: an earthquake occurs\n- ⟦{戦争|せんそう}→戦争：01450_sensou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{起|お}こる: a war breaks out\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{発生|はっせい}する→発生する：25529_hasseisuru⟧: to occur, break out (formal)\n- ⟦{生|しょう}じる→生じる：02118_shoujiru⟧: to arise (written style)\n- ⟦{勃発|ぼっぱつ}する→勃発：11823_boppatsu⟧: to break out (wars, conflicts)",
